      {
        "id": 8975,
        "name": "Hummingbird",
        "username": "Hummingbird",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-06T07:29:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Kismet's Scattered Mind reads \"Whenever that hero deals damage, their player must discard 1 card\". Does \"whenever\" refer to one instance or something else? If Tempest is affected by Scattered Mind (has it in front of him) and plays Chain Lightning to deal damage to 3 targets, then does Tempest discard 3 cards?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:38.362Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 8972,
        "topic_slug": "whenever-that-hero-deals-damage",
        "display_username": "Hummingbird",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
