        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Kismet&#39;s Scattered Mind reads &quot;Whenever that hero deals damage, their player must discard 1 card&quot;. Does &quot;whenever&quot; refer to one instance or something else? If Tempest is affected by Scattered Mind (has it in front of him) and plays Chain Lightning to deal damage to 3 targets, then does Tempest discard 3 cards?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
